(6547031, 974344, 124190, '<td valign="top">Far out....I miss it.......this was fun....the Citgo sign is STILL there!   Kenmore square, right?    Fenway Park.  Charles River. Com. Ave. Storrow drive. Were you in the John Hancock building or in a plane???   I took a photo of myself in the Hancock mirrored elevators in 1976......I was trying to figure out "who I was"   lolol I was an art student....ha.   Fabulous colors.   Gives me the same sense I felt back in the day....the New England detached coolness.</td>', 'Far out....I miss it.......this was fun....the Citgo sign is STILL there!   Kenmore square, right?    Fenway Park.  Charles River. Com. Ave. Storrow drive. Were you in the John Hancock building or in a plane???   I took a photo of myself in the Hancock mirrored elevators in 1976......I was trying to figure out "who I was"   lolol I was an art student....ha.   Fabulous colors.   Gives me the same sense I felt back in the day....the New England detached coolness.', '2011-09-21 10:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
